  "description": "After challenging the official story of a conglomerate chairman’s suspicious death backfires, investigative journalist Gu Won is demoted to the entertainment desk. Now relegated to chasing celebrity gossip, he is assigned to dig up dirt on the nation’s top actor, Han Ji-Hee. However, the hunter becomes the prey when a night of tailing ends in a blackout. Gu Won wakes up in the same bed as his target, met only with a cryptic promise of a reward once his memory finally returns.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
